    "description": "Fondation Max Van Berchem and ALIPH, both in Geneva, have both provided substantial grants for Professor Pradines of AKU-ISMC to pursue the documenting and conserving of the sites of medieval and Mughal period (1526-1857) port cities in the Indus Delta.",
